  <item>
    <title>034-渣男套路多到防不胜防？6个原则，让天下没有识不破的渣男</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671fa5bed2febbfe7ad4d7d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671fa5bed2febbfe7ad4d7d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生这么长，谁还没遇到过几个“渣男”！可为什么我们频频被渣，却还次次上钩？面对渣男层出不穷的套路，我们到底该如何保护自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近，Tian 读了社会心理学经典著作</span><em><span>《影响力》</span></em><span>，她惊讶地发现书中揭示的内容和渣男套路惊人地相似。原来早在30年前，“影响力”教父罗伯特·西奥迪尼就已经把“渣男套路”总结得明明白白！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客就将深入分享书中提及的 6 个“影响力原则”，与大家一起聊聊渣男的那些伎俩，以及我们该如何识破套路、成功反渣，在情感生活中保持清醒，从容应对。</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 互惠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> </span><strong><span>警惕渣男给的“免费”恩惠</span></strong><span>，everything has a price</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 升级版「互惠式让步」让你更难说“不”：</span><strong><span>渣男是怎么让你无法拒绝他的要求的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 承诺和一致</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> 为什么人在下注后，对自己所下注的马匹获胜的信心立刻大增？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">33:31</a> “抛低球”：</span><strong><span>渣男没兑现当初的承诺，我们却反而更爱他了？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 社会认同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> “罐头笑声”和“排队黄牛”</span><strong><span>明明假得那么明显，我们却还是会上钩</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> “多元无知”：</span><strong><span>围观的人越多，你得到的帮助反而越少！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 我们会根据他人的行为来判断自己怎么做才合适，尤其是和自己相似的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 喜好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3806">63:26</a> “喜欢一个人的 5 大理由”：</span><strong><span>渣男原来是这么“包装”自己的！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 权威</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5174">86:14</a> 只要</span><strong><span>权威一声令下</span></strong><span>，我们就会</span><strong><span>放弃思考，盲目服从</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5421">90:21</a> 权威的象征不等于权威：</span><strong><span>“渣男”化身“霸总”，好一局杀猪盘！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 稀缺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6107">101:47</a></span><strong><span> “绝版”、“限时限量”、“独家小道消息”</span></strong><span>：我们总会被看似稀缺的东西所吸引</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6424">107:04</a> </span><strong><span>“大家都抢着要”的东西最具诱惑力，让人丧失理智</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lopR74co8iHRflUf4sz6wuaTuBdB.m4a" length="112284300" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:55:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKICw0bHd9IYskT64hCuqj1B_RA.jpg"/>
